.TH HMAP_INIT 3
.SH NAME
hmap_init \- initialize a hash map database
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include <hmap.h>
.P
.BI "int hmap_init(int " bucket_size ", HMAP_DB** " hmap_db ");"
.SH DESCRIPTION
.BR hmap_init ()
allocates and initializes a new hash map database with the specified
number of buckets.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns HMAP_SUCCESS (0) on success, or an error code.